{
  "_schema": [
    "UNIFIED use-case registry (Track E consolidation) — HYBRID namespace: a COARSE use-case",
    "carries a `baseline` spec + `budget_floor`, and optional fine `variants` that OVERRIDE the",
    "baseline (DRY: define common specs once, refine per variant). This replaces the 4 drifting",
    "files (config/use_case_kb.json, use_case_knowledge_base.json, use_case_knowledge.json,",
    "data/use_case_kb.json) with ONE source per vertical, bound to taxonomy host nodes.",
    "Resolution: resolve(coarse, variant?) = baseline <- variant override; budget_floor = variant",
    "floor if present else coarse floor. `content_advisory` is ADVISORY ONLY (surface a note/",
    "clarification, never a hard block — the store sells hardware, not game content).",
    "Values migrated to match the current live workhorse (use_case_knowledge_base.json) so the",
    "switch is behaviour-neutral; new granularity (variants) is additive."
  ],
  "vertical": "electronics",
  "version": "1.0",
  "host_nodes": ["el-6"],
  "use_cases": {
